{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n<your_rewritten_code_5>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    private static final long MOD = 998244353L;\n    private static long[] fact, invFact;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Main solver = new Main();\n        solver.run();\n    }\n\n    private void run() {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        long tmp = sc.nextLong();\n        if (n <= tmp) {\n            System.out.println(0);\n            return;\n        }\n        int k = (int) tmp;\n        setup(400000);\n        long ans = 0;\n        int sign = 1;\n        long base = nCr(n, n - k);\n        for (int i = n - k; i >= 1; i--) {\n            long term = (long) sign * nCr(n - k, i) % MOD;\n            term = term * power(i, n) % MOD;\n            ans = (ans + term) % MOD;\n            sign = -sign;\n        }\n        ans = ans * base % MOD;\n        if (k != 0) ans = (ans * 2) % MOD;\n        if (ans < 0) ans += MOD;\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n\n    private void setup(int maxN) {\n        fact = new long[maxN + 1];\n        invFact = new long[maxN + 1];\n        fact[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= maxN; i++) {\n            fact[i] = fact[i - 1] * i % MOD;\n        }\n        invFact[maxN] = power(fact[maxN], MOD - 2);\n        for (int i = maxN - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n            invFact[i] = invFact[i + 1] * (i + 1) % MOD;\n        }\n    }\n\n    private long nCr(int n, int r) {\n        if (r < 0 || r > n) return 0;\n        return fact[n] * invFact[r] % MOD * invFact[n - r] % MOD;\n    }\n\n    private long power(long base, long exp) {\n        long res = 1;\n        base %= MOD;\n        while (exp > 0) {\n            if ((exp & 1) == 1) res = res * base % MOD;\n            base = base * base % MOD;\n            exp >>= 1;\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n}\n</your_rewritten_code_5>\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\nMOD = 998244353\n\ndef power(base, exp):\n    res = 1\n    base %= MOD\n    while exp > 0:\n        if (exp & 1) == 1:\n            res = (res * base) % MOD\n        base = (base * base) % MOD\n        exp >>= 1\n    return res\n\ndef setup(maxN):\n    fact = [1] * (maxN + 1)\n    invFact = [1] * (maxN + 1)\n    for i in range(1, maxN + 1):\n        fact[i] = (fact[i-1] * i) % MOD\n    invFact[maxN] = power(fact[maxN], MOD - 2)\n    for i in range(maxN - 1, -1, -1):\n        invFact[i] = (invFact[i+1] * (i + 1)) % MOD\n    return fact, invFact\n\ndef nCr(n, r, fact, invFact):\n    if r < 0 or r > n:\n        return 0\n    return (fact[n] * invFact[r] % MOD) * invFact[n - r] % MOD\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    tmp = int(data[1])\n    if n <= tmp:\n        print(0)\n        return\n    k = tmp\n    fact, invFact = setup(400000)\n    ans = 0\n    sign = 1\n    base = nCr(n, n - k, fact, invFact)\n    for i in range(n - k, 0, -1):\n        term = sign * nCr(n - k, 